	(text "FB3 also supplies CPUSLDO: allow at least 30mA.\nDo not pick up feedback at the inductor output.\nKeep each VIN bypass capacitor close to its pin.\nInductors: 1uH, DCR < 100mOhm; check saturation margin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 125.73 0)
